@startuml
!theme plain
title Payment Intent State Machine — Illustrative Only
[*] --> CREATED
CREATED --> AWAITING_CUSTOMER : intent registered
AWAITING_CUSTOMER --> PROCESSING : payer authorized
PROCESSING --> SUCCEEDED : final success confirmed
PROCESSING --> FAILED : final failure confirmed
PROCESSING --> UNKNOWN : ambiguous provider outcome
UNKNOWN --> PROCESSING : still pending
UNKNOWN --> SUCCEEDED : authoritative success
UNKNOWN --> FAILED : authoritative failure
AWAITING_CUSTOMER --> EXPIRED : confirmed expiry
SUCCEEDED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
note right of UNKNOWN
Timeout alone never proves financial failure.
Provider-specific settlement rules still apply.
end note
@enduml